      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 42,
          "verse": 10
        }
      ],
      "en": "As with a sword in my bones, my adversaries reproach me, while they continually ask me, “Where is your God?”",
      "ko": "내 뼈를 찌르는 칼 같이 내 대적이 나를 비방하여 늘 말하기를 네 하나님이 어디 있느냐 하도다",
      "source_text_hash": "a49e46fa3e0775b88ffa8ef8d188f61dedafb3eb23c651b53b3abe645196e1dc",
      "translation_text_hash": "808444db6dafa0444e56a076b4eba1cd8e7fc9b1a3279934ad6a88a65261e0d9",
